# Uvagf · 20 · Pbhag cubgbf jvgubhg penfuvat

## Uvag 1

Orsber lbh jevgr n yvar, yvfg rirel cvrpr bs funerq fgngr naq fnl juvpu ybpx cebgrpgf vg. Gurer
ner 2 xvaqf urer: gur znc sebz anzrf gb pbhagref, naq gur inyhr vafvqr rnpu pbhagre. Znal
tbebhgvarf ernq naq jevgr obgu. Nfx sbe rnpu zrgubq: juvpu bs gur 2 qbrf vg gbhpu, naq qbrf vg
arrq gb punatr vg be bayl ernq vg? Gura nfx gur frpbaq dhrfgvba sebz gur bcravat: juvpu bs gubfr
fgrcf pbhyq or fybj, naq vf gurer n jnl gb qb vg nsgre lbh yrg tb bs gur ybpx?

## Uvag 2

Gur znc ubyqf cbvagref, `znc[fgevat]*Pbhagre`, naq rnpu `Pbhagre` pneevrf vgf bja `flap.Zhgrk`
arkg gb vgf inyhr. `Pbhagre(anzr)` zhfg ybbx hc naq vafreg haqre 1 ybpx: ybpx, ybbx hc, vafreg vs
zvffvat, haybpx. Vs lbh haybpx orgjrra gur ybbxhc naq gur vafreg, 2 tbebhgvarf pna obgu zvff naq
perngr 2 pbhagref sbe 1 anzr. `Qenva` zhfg ernq naq erfrg rnpu inyhr haqre gung pbhagre'f ybpx,
va 1 fgrc; n `Inyhr()` sbyybjrq ol n frcnengr erfrg ybfrf rirel `Nqq` va orgjrra. Purpx `a < 0`
va `Nqq` orsber lbh ybpx, be haybpx jvgu `qrsre`: n cnavp gung yrnirf gur zhgrk ybpxrq oybpxf gur
pbhagre sberire. Sbe `Jevgr`, pbcl gur inyhrf svefg, gura yrg tb bs rirel ybpx, gura jevgr.

## Uvag 3

- `Ertvfgel`: n `flap.Zhgrk` naq n `znc[fgevat]*Pbhagre`, perngrq va `ArjErtvfgel`.
- `Pbhagre(anzr)`: ybpx, `qrsre` haybpx, ybbx hc, perngr naq fgber vs zvffvat, erghea gur cbvagre.
- `Pbhagre`: n `flap.Zhgrk` naq na `vag64`. `Nqq`: purpx `a`, gura ybpx, `qrsre` haybpx, nqq.
  `Inyhr`: ybpx, `qrsre` haybpx, erghea. N fznyy harkcbegrq zrgubq ernqf gur inyhr naq frgf vg gb
  0 haqre 1 ybpx, sbe `Qenva`.
- `Fancfubg` naq `Qenva` qb gur fnzr jnyx jvgu n qvssrerag ernq. Ybpx gur ertvfgel, ohvyq n arj
  fyvpr jvgu 1 `Fnzcyr` cre znc ragel, haybpx, fbeg gur fyvpr jvgu `fyvprf.FbegShap` naq
  `fgevatf.Pbzcner`. Jevgr gung jnyx bapr naq cnff gur ernq nf n shapgvba.
- `Jevgr`: pnyy `Fancfubg`, sbezng rirel yvar vagb n `olgrf.Ohssre` be `fgevatf.Ohvyqre`, gura
  pnyy `j.Jevgr` bapr naq erghea vgf reebe. Ab ybpx vf uryq ng gung cbvag.
